<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>

<style>
    /* Continuous Image Animation Logic */
    .image-slider-container {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        height: 400px; /* Fixed height for consistency */
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .slide-img {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        opacity: 0;
        animation: imageFadeLoop 15s infinite;
    }

    /* Staggered delays: 15s total loop / 3 images = 5s each */
    .slide-img:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0s; }
    .slide-img:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 5s; }
    .slide-img:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 10s; }

    @keyframes imageFadeLoop {
        0% { opacity: 0; }
        5% { opacity: 1; }   /* Fade in */
        33% { opacity: 1; }  /* Stay visible */
        38% { opacity: 0; }  /* Fade out */
        100% { opacity: 0; }
    }
</style>

<body class="bg-white">
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <section class="relative image-slider-container flex items-center justify-center">
        <img src="/public/image/14.jpg.jpeg" alt="Installation 1" class="slide-img">
        <img src="/public/image/15.jpg.jpeg" alt="Installation 2" class="slide-img">
        <img src="/public/image/14.jpg.jpeg" alt="Installation 3" class="slide-img">

        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-900/50 z-10"></div>

        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center relative z-20">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight uppercase mb-4 text-white">Installation & Storage Guide</h1>
            <p class="text-slate-200 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light">
                Comprehensive guidelines for handling, storing, and installing our high-performance piping systems to ensure long-term structural integrity.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-4">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 mb-16">
                <div class="md:w-1/2">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 uppercase border-l-4 border-yellow-500 pl-4">Standard Installation</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        Our HDPE and thermoplastic systems are designed for ease of installation. However, adhering to thermal expansion and jointing protocols is critical for leak-proof performance.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="space-y-4">
                        <li class="flex gap-4">
                            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">01</span>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800">Trench Preparation</h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Ensure the trench bed is level and free of sharp rocks or debris that could puncture the pipe wall.</p>
                            </div>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-4">
                            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">02</span>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800">Jointing Methods</h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Utilize Butt-Fusion or Electro-Fusion welding for a monolithic, leak-proof system.</p>
                            </div>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-4">
                            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">03</span>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800">Thermal Expansion</h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Allow for "snaking" of the pipe in the trench to accommodate expansion and contraction.</p>
                            </div>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="md:w-1/2">
                    <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl image-slider-container">
                        <img src="/public/image/14.jpg.jpeg" alt="Butt Fusion Welding" class="slide-img">
                        <img src="/public/image/15.jpg.jpeg" alt="Electro Fusion Process" class="slide-img">
                        <img src="/public/image/14.jpg.jpeg" alt="Trench Installation" class="slide-img">
                        
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/70 to-transparent flex items-end p-8 z-10">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-white font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs block mb-1 opacity-70">On-Site Documentation</span>
                                <span class="text-white font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm">Field Welding Operations</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="border-gray-100 max-w-7xl mx-auto">

    <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-gray-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase">Storage Best Practices</h2>
                <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-red-600 mx-auto mt-4"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="bg-white p-8 border-b-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-yellow-500 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="text-yellow-600 mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-10 h-10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-slate-800">Stacking Heights</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Pipes should be stored on level ground. Avoid stacking higher than 1.5 meters to prevent ovalization.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-8 border-b-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-yellow-500 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="text-yellow-600 mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-10 h-10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-slate-800">UV Protection</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        While pipes contain UV stabilizers, prolonged outdoor storage (over 12 months) requires covering.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-8 border-b-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-yellow-500 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="text-yellow-600 mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-10 h-10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-slate-800">Chemical Contact</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Keep storage areas free from lubricating oils, gasoline, or other aggressive solvents.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 px-4 bg-white text-center">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto border-2 border-dashed border-gray-200 p-10 rounded-3xl">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Need the Full Technical Manual?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 mb-8">Download our detailed PDF for site engineers including welding parameters and weight charts.</p>
            <a href="/public/image/brochure.pdf" class="inline-block bg-red-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-red-700 transition-colors shadow-lg">
                DOWNLOAD PDF MANUAL
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>